<title>MOROCCO: Morocco asks for tenders to build Tangier port.</title>
<headline>Morocco asks for tenders to build Tangier port.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco on Thursday launched an international tender to build a port in the northern city of Tangier, the ministry of public works said.</p>
<p>&quot;The project which is estimated at $300 million is proposed for the private sector in the framework of a concession of BOT type (Build, Operate and Transfer),&quot; the ministry said in statement.</p>
<p>This is the first time such a financing formula was adopted for the country's port infrastructure, it said.</p>
</text>
